	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tantum comperi, ut, si <placeName ref="l862">Helvetii</placeName> una cum <persName ref="p8112">Gallo</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">König <persName ref="p8112">Heinrich II.</persName> von <placeName ref="l832">Frankreich</placeName>.</note> reciperent <placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> in tutelam, non essent ad hyberna <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>cęsarem<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName> - Gerüchtweise hieß es, er wolle in <placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName> überwintern; s. die Verweise in <ref target="file13034">Nr. 2985</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17250-4" type="qv"/>; und <ref target="file13043">Nr. 2994</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17260-1" type="qv"/>; <ref target="file13046">Nr. 2997</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17263-2" type="qv"/>. - Die <placeName ref="l491">Straßburger</placeName> Politiker, die eine Zeitlang um den Schutz <placeName ref="l832">Frankreichs</placeName> geworben hatten, bevorzugten es schließlich, mit dem Kaiser einen Frieden einzugehen (s. <bibl source="b480">PC</bibl> IV/1 599-602, Anm. 1-3; 645, Anm. 6; 670-672, <ref target="file10633">Nr. 595</ref>. 597), auch wenn sie später die Anwesenheit des Kaisers in ihrer Stadt zu verhindern versuchten (s. aaO, S. 731-736, <ref target="file10688">Nr. 650</ref>).<ptr target="zfnfn17276-1" type="zfn"/></note> admissuri.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Norunt enim, quod, id si fecerint, exitiale sibi futurum sit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Clam apud nostros, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>qui secreta tractant,<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Die Geheimen Räte in <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>.</note> negocium egi et responsum inveni valde adcommodum, nempe si illi <persName ref="p8112">Gallum</persName> urgerent, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ut rem referret ad Confoederatos, efficatius fore.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Hactenus enim, quicquid evangelicę civitates<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>, <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName>, <placeName ref="l441">Schaffhausen</placeName> und <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</note> eiusmodi <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>negociorum retulerint ad reliquos<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Den übrigen <placeName ref="l2453">Neun Orten</placeName> der <placeName ref="l862">Eidgenossenschaft</placeName>.</note>, suspectum fuerit, tanquam seipsos quęrerent, non bonum commune.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Consilium <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>hoc ideo expono, ut rectius omnia apud tuos, quibus secreta sunt exponenda tuto,<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Gemeint sind vor allem die beiden <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Bürgermeister <persName ref="p1419">Johannes Haab</persName> und <persName ref="p1888">Hans Rudolf Lavater</persName>, wie auch <persName ref="p8123">Georg Müller</persName> und <persName ref="p6793">Itelhans Thumysen</persName>; vgl. <bibl source="b22">HBBW XIX</bibl> 27 und Anm. 90.</note> queas agere.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quales <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quidem si non invenias, tutius erit omnino tacere.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Hoc est igitur, quod volo, ut inquiras clam, si quid illius <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>defensionis possit sperari una cum <persName ref="p8112">Gallo</persName>, deinde ut renuncies in tempore.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Certum est, si cęsar illum <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nidum<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><placeName ref="l491">Straßburg</placeName>.</note> occuparit, nobis facesset negocium, si non in totum deleverit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">In sinum intimum hęc tibi et eis, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quibus tu rem concredideris.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Rediit ex nobilibus quidam a vobis domum, <persName ref="p7702">Ostheimerus</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p7702">Heinrich von Ostheim</persName>, ein <placeName ref="l28">Basler</placeName> Söldnerhauptmann; s. <bibl>AK</bibl> V 118, Anm. 1; VI 42, Anm. 1, u.ö.</note>, qui narravit iram <placeName ref="l2448">Quinquepagicorum</placeName> contra cęsaris <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>dolos.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Indicato, quęso, quid rei sit.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Ex <placeName ref="l15">Antwerpia</placeName> civium nostrorum quidam<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Unbekannt.</note> domum reversus certo nunciat de fuso <persName ref="p7459">Burensi</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p7459">Maximilian von Egmont</persName>, Graf von <placeName ref="l2126">Büren</placeName>; vgl. <ref target="file13044">Nr. 2995</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17261-1" type="qv"/>. - Ein falsches Gerücht.</note>, et addit rumorem <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>glande periisse illum; aliter non adserit.<pb type="edition" next="471"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Quantaquanta pecunia est, queruntur landsknechti nihil si<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>bi solvi; id quod fit et <placeName ref="l18">Augustę</placeName>.<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Vgl. <ref target="file13052">Nr. 3003</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17270-1" type="qv"/>; <ref target="file13054">Nr. 3005</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17272-3" type="qv"/>; <ref target="file13059">Nr. 3010</ref>,[2]. - <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> hatte diese Nachricht aus dem im nächsten Satz erwähnten Brief <persName ref="p8018">Hallers</persName> erfahren.</note></s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Scripsit <persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> his diebus breviter copiosas.<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">copiosas literas. - Der Brief war an <persName ref="p5075">Hieronymus Gunz</persName> gerichtet, und <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> fertigte sich eine Teilabschrift davon an; s. <ref target="file13052">Nr. 3003</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17270-1" type="qv"/>.</note></s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Equidem video, quod ubi cęsar est, ibi et infernum esse.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Videtur, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>quod in <placeName ref="l2202">Sodomis</placeName> non ita sit<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> turpiter actum,<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Gen 13, 13</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>18, 20</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Ez 16, 49</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Jud 1, 7</ref></cit>.</note> ut agitur <placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName> a militibus omnis generis,<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Vgl. z.B. <ref target="file13027">Nr. 2978</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17244-5" type="qv"/>.</note> ne quid dicam de pfaffis.<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Vgl. <ref target="file12991">Nr. 2942</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17207-5" type="qv"/>.</note></s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Tim<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ore domini et magna prudentia<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Ps 111 (Vulg. 110), 10</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Spr 15, 33</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>19, 23</ref></cit>; usw.</note> opus est itaque <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiis</placeName> nostris, si voluerint esse incolumes.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Petit cęsar amiciciam, nonnisi ut fallat.<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Bezug auf den Brief des Kaisers an die <placeName ref="l862">Eidgenossen</placeName> vom 28. Juli; s. dazu <ref target="file13016">Nr. 2967</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17232-2" type="qv"/>.</note></s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Differt enim ita nos et securos reddit, ut imparatos obruat <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et obprimat, qualiter et <placeName ref="l2481">Suevis</placeName> tempore fecit brumę.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Fraude et dolo refertus est, et his illudit, usque dum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>voti compos efficitur.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Caveamus nobis in domino!</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Pestis ad nos venit.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Ora pro nobis!</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Christo cum tuis, etc.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName>, 10. septembris anno 1547.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8418">Os. Myc.</persName></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">D. <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro praestantissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ministro Christi optimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>in Christo venerando suo.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Zu[m Münste]r<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Textverlust bei der Entfernung des Siegels. Die Auflösung ist unsicher.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Züri[c]h</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
